{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36276","headline":"和剡县陈明府登县楼 · 方干","name":"和剡县陈明府登县楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郭里人家如掌上，檐前树木映窗棂。\n烟霞若接天台地，分野应侵婺女星。\n驿路古今通北阙，仙溪日夜入东溟。\n彩衣才子多吟啸，公退时时见画屏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}